        "",
        "## Executive summary",
        "The agreement contains severe vertical competition and contract enforceability risks across Bangladesh, the United States, and the European Union, driven by indefinite exclusivity renewals, a 6-year post-term non-compete, and coercive resale price maintenance penalties.",
