        "### 1. Exclusive Supply Combined with Automatic 5-Year Renewal",
        "- **Authorities:** `TFEU Art. 101(1)` (verified); `VBER 2022/720, Art. 5` (corpus-listed; confirm against primary source); `15 U.S.C. § 14` (corpus-listed; confirm against primary source).",
        "",
